  "description": "The Mmmbop is here for the fun times. Slack, aggressive and built to hang with any of your full-suspension riding mates. Perfect to ride all-day but drop the saddle and the magic happens…\nA 63.75 degree head angle inspires confidence on the steeps, the 150mm RockShox Yari provides bucketloads of composure, and the taught frame keeps things tracking no matter what.\nThe bike is way more than the sum of its parts, and that’s saying something: the 1.0 sees an upgrade to the 12-speed Deore groupset and SRAM brakes. The award-winning Brand-X Ascend dropper is a trail essential and tubeless ready Nukeproof Neutron V2 wheels are the perfect partner for the range topping Maxxis 3C EXO+ Minion rubber.\nSo whether you’re entering the hardtail category at an enduro race, exploring a backcountry epic or just smashing around the local woods, the Mmmbop is ready for anything.",
